{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29909","headline":"送友人归宜春 · 纪唐夫","name":"送友人归宜春","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"落花兼柳絮，无处不纷纷。\n远道空归去，流莺独自闻。\n墅桥喧碓水，山郭入楼云。\n故里南陔曲，秋期欲送君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"纪唐夫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29909.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29909","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}